        "TileImage": "$($repository 02030e13-2f72-489f-b1b6-c76d0c324bf7).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47, and welcome back to Argentina, Mendoza. Today&apos;s targets include Elliot Gill, better known as the wine legend. There&apos;s a big wine festival going on in Mendoza today, which Gill has of course attended. Elliot is known in the media as a charismatic gentleman, but underneath it all he&apos;s a saboteur and a blackmailer of smaller wineries. Then we have a guy named Zechariah Stafford. I don&apos;t know much about him, but he&apos;s apparently some kind of Elliot&apos;s lifelong bodyguard. have fun!",
